00:12:56,000 --> 00:13:02,000
Finding Altamira is a drama, history film directed by Hugh Hudson.

3
00:19:24,000 --> 00:19:30,000
The story of nine-year old Maria and her father Marcelino who, in 1879, found the
first pre-historic cave paintings at the now world famous Altamira cave.

4
