Abbé Breuil, played by Tristán Ulloa.

10
01:04:40,000 --> 01:04:46,000
Finding Altamira (released as Altamira in Spain) is a 2016 Spanish biographical
drama film starring Antonio Banderas, and directed by Hugh Hudson.

11
01:11:08,000 --> 01:11:14,000
It was Hudson's first fiction film as director since I Dreamed of Africa in 2000,
although he wrote the screenplay for the 2014 fictional film, The Journey Home.

12
01:17:36,000 --> 01:17:42,000
It was his final film before his death in 2023.

13
01:24:04,000 --> 01:24:10,000
The film explores themes of spain, cave, discovery, altamira.

14
01:30:32,000 --> 01:30:38,000
The tone is emotional.
